<!-- #2605: breaks against the 0.4521.0 baseline that reached develop while package validation could not fail a run
     (the pack ended in `|| true`). Each was a deliberate pre-1.0 change; the owner reviewed and accepted all of them on
     2026-11-27, and from then on a break that is not recorded here fails the run. Here: the pipeline behavior types and their audit behavior were removed, the partition assignment store moved to a published partition map with handover (new interface members, the old PublishAsync gone), the repair progress reading and its percent helper were replaced, schedules gained cancel-by-key and overdue claims (members added to IScheduleManager and IScheduleClaimer), and constructors and positional records of the work coordinator strategies, integrity, capability and flush types changed shape as their dependencies changed. -->
